      ],
      "source": "https://www.haddam.org/571/About",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Shipyards sprang up along both sides of the river, while nearby brooks supplied waterpower for small mills and factories.",
